There are a few things in society I want to help fight in a meaningful way that not many know or think about, I also have a novel easy 30 second elevator pitch to help secure opsec that might be fun to code, I will leave my PGP key below if you want to hear it. 

Regardless, here is what I mainly wish to bring awareness to, previous transactions have touched on this issue, but it is something so pervasive and awful that many just conclude it isn't an issue, it has been an evil that has gone on far too long.

Dental amalgam is half elemental mercury, and it has long been known to chronically release elemental mercury vapor in the mouth, and absorption through the lungs is the worst method of absorption, as it is directly absorbed into the blood and tissues including the brain, and as the most neurotoxic heavy metal known to man, why should a toddler have it chronically released throughout critical development windows?

This is common sense, and even in the 19th century this has been known to cause health issues, research the dental amalgam wars (which massively helped lead the formation of the ADA by the way) and there are many reports highlighting erethism and health issues in adults, let alone toddlers who today have it installed simply because of "micro cavities" which are only seen on x-ray as an excuse to drill and fill healthy teeth with incredibly toxic material that should have been banned far too long ago.


I also was diagnosed autism and ever since removing my own fillings I have been gradually getting better with some of the neurological issues I was dealing with, so I really would like to advocate awareness and eventual banishment of the toxic substance.


